P4 is partly wrong: the local DDI 0100I text covers ARMv6 as well as earlier versions, though its BFI/BFC search is empty. The decoder also has no CPU-model gate for BFI; the registered `testarm` configuration selects SA1110 and uses this shared decoder. I’m checking the test’s diagnostic handling and the remaining C99 host-width assumptions.
