web search: 'acquire'
codex
The existing probe consumes the emulator’s output through a PTY and does not print the raw transcript. An external stderr grep could therefore report “zero diagnostics” without checking the sanitizer output. Each test needs to inspect its captured transcript. I also checked all 1,024 field pairs: the proposed mask values match an independent per-bit oracle, but that is not a C sanitizer run.
